          "status": "confirmed",
          "text": {
            "zh": "读完 Westminster 后参军一年多，再靠奖学金进牛津 Christ Church 读法律。",
            "en": "Went to Westminster, did over a year in the Army, then read Law at Christ Church, Oxford, on a scholarship."
