        "residence": {
          "status": "not_found"
        },
        "events": {
          "status": "confirmed",
          "text": {
            "zh": "约两年前他从马上重重摔下，导致脑出血。",
            "en": "About two years earlier, a bad fall from a horse gave him a brain haemorrhage."
          },
          "sourceIds": [
            "film-f63"
          ],
          "questionIds": [
            "f63-079"
          ]
        },
        "outlook": {
          "status": "confirmed",
          "text": {
            "zh": "他说没有遗憾，无论处境如何，总是尽量往好处做；对他最重要的是妻子、家人、朋友和家。",
            "en": "He has no regrets and always tries to make the best of everything, even in a bad situation; his wife, family, friends and homes matter most."
          },
          "sourceIds": [
            "film-f63"
          ],
          "questionIds": [
